# Frontend stays in the UI repo

This workspace is the Django API and the HTMX reference UI. The React app is the sibling repo `D:\projects\horilla-hr-ui`.

Do not create or edit frontend code from here. That includes `horilla-hr-ui`, and any `.tsx`, `.jsx`, or UI-only `.ts` file, even when the task is a screen.

When a task needs a screen, finish the API in this repo, then guide the UI in the reply:

- The route and what the screen shows
- Endpoints, methods, request bodies, and response fields
- Which permission codenames gate each button
- What to leave unchanged in the HTMX UI

```text
✅ horilla_api change here, then a short handoff the UI repo can implement
❌ Edit D:\projects\horilla-hr-ui or add a React component from this workspace
```
